Triangle read by rows: infinite braid made of periodically-colored yarns in which the crossing of two adjacent yarns occurs when two color 0's are side by side (see comments).

The 85 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

